<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3945/50 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7124/34 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9254/64 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4618/28 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.34/35  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7798/08   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1707.4/8.9  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     125.98/08   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6651/26   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0519/69   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5260/80   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6321/31</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$340.60/10</p>
</text>
